#, fuzzy
msgid "Countries are unlikely to achieve their health goals through investing in isolated or siloed health systems. Instead, they should build shared data and digital capabilities that support multiple <a0>health programmes</a0>, multiple diseases and multiple levels and places of care."
msgstr "各国不太可能通过投资于孤立或各自为政的卫生系统来实现其卫生目标。相反，各国应当建立共享的数据和数字能力，以支持多个<a0>卫生规划</a0>、多种疾病以及多个照护层级和场所。"

